{"schemaVersion":1,"id":288,"sections":[{"id":"539001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20702],"start":0,"count":17},{"id":"539001-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20703],"start":17,"count":23}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"539001-PROLOGUE:20702:1","scriptId":20702,"text":"又一次风沙大作，能见度迅速下降，很快连自己的手都要看不见了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-20.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"539001-PROLOGUE:20702:2","scriptId":20702,"text":"“佐伊，佩妮都听得见吗？快进吉普车，千万不要犹豫。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-20.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"539001-PROLOGUE:20702:3","scriptId":20702,"text":"“知道了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-20.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"539001-PROLOGUE:20702:4","scriptId":20702,"text":"“好的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-20.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"539001-PROLOGUE:20702:5","scriptId":20702,"text":"虽然立刻提醒了佩妮和佐伊，但因为视野急速缩小，也不知道她们有没有照做。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-20.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"539001-PROLOGUE:20702:6","scriptId":20702,"text":"恍惚中确实有听到关车门的声音。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-20.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"539001-PROLOGUE:20702:7","scriptId":20702,"text":"这次只过了五分钟，沙尘暴就褪去了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-20.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"539001-PROLOGUE:20702:8","scriptId":20702,"text":"“什么！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-20.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"539001-PROLOGUE:20702:10","scriptId":20702,"text":"周围的景色突然从沙漠变成了蘑菇林……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"539001-PROLOGUE:20702:11","scriptId":20702,"text":"“诶！？这蘑菇林是怎么回事？而且那边又出现了战车兽啊！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"539001-PROLOGUE:20702:12","scriptId":20702,"text":"顺着佐伊说的方向看去，还真看到了一些战车兽。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"539001-PROLOGUE:20702:13","scriptId":20702,"text":"“等等？佩妮人呢！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"539001-PROLOGUE:20702:14","scriptId":20702,"text":"这时候才发现，佩妮不见了，她并不在车里，后排只有佐伊一个人。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"539001-PROLOGUE:20702:15","scriptId":20702,"text":"“不是吧……佩妮！！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"539001-PROLOGUE:20702:16","scriptId":20702,"text":"佐伊立刻打开了车门，跳了下去大声呼唤着佩妮的名字。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"539001-PROLOGUE:20702:17","scriptId":20702,"text":"然后并没有得到佩妮的回应，反而是那些战车兽靠拢过来了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"539001-PROLOGUE:20702:18","scriptId":20702,"text":"“啧……事情变得麻烦起来了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"539001-EPILOGUE:20703:0","scriptId":20703,"text":"没想到光凭佐伊一个人就把那些战车兽全部清理掉了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"539001-EPILOGUE:20703:1","scriptId":20703,"text":"“……不知不觉，佐伊这家伙也变得那么厉害了吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"539001-EPILOGUE:20703:2","scriptId":20703,"text":"不过佐伊还是在不停地呼唤佩妮的名字。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"539001-EPILOGUE:20703:3","scriptId":20703,"text":"“佩——妮——！！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"539001-EPILOGUE:20703:4","scriptId":20703,"text":"完全没有回应，佩妮就像凭空蒸发了一般。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"539001-EPILOGUE:20703:5","scriptId":20703,"text":"“佐伊！回来，回到车里来！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"539001-EPILOGUE:20703:6","scriptId":20703,"text":"“但……但是佩妮她！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"539001-EPILOGUE:20703:7","scriptId":20703,"text":"“这是命令！回到车里来！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"539001-EPILOGUE:20703:8","scriptId":20703,"text":"“是……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"539001-EPILOGUE:20703:9","scriptId":20703,"text":"虽然佐伊一脸不情愿，但还是遵从了命令。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"539001-EPILOGUE:20703:10","scriptId":20703,"text":"“佐伊，冷静，现在我们要做的事情是整理现况。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"539001-EPILOGUE:20703:11","scriptId":20703,"text":"“胡乱呼叫只会吸引更多的战车兽，不是正确的做法。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"539001-EPILOGUE:20703:12","scriptId":20703,"text":"“是……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"539001-EPILOGUE:20703:13","scriptId":20703,"text":"“这种情况我想我们以前有遇到过。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"539001-EPILOGUE:20703:14","scriptId":20703,"text":"“什么！？遇到过吗？我怎么没有印象。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"539001-EPILOGUE:20703:15","scriptId":20703,"text":"“这个情况和兰布达的传送非常相似，你不觉得吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"539001-EPILOGUE:20703:16","scriptId":20703,"text":"“对啊！我怎么没想到呢？这里的一切都是那么真实，根本就不是什么海市蜃楼。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"539001-EPILOGUE:20703:17","scriptId":20703,"text":"“或许在刚开始我们确实遇到了海市蜃楼……但出于某些原因被进行了传送……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"539001-EPILOGUE:20703:18","scriptId":20703,"text":"“那佩妮岂不是很危险？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"539001-EPILOGUE:20703:19","scriptId":20703,"text":"“因为佩妮在传送的时候没有上车，所以被传送到了其他地方。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"539001-EPILOGUE:20703:20","scriptId":20703,"text":"“那我们要怎么找到佩妮呢？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"539001-EPILOGUE:20703:21","scriptId":20703,"text":"“五分钟，就在这里先等五分钟，如果没有再发生传送的话，我们就驱车开始找佩妮。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"539001-EPILOGUE:20703:22","scriptId":20703,"text":"“听你的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
